{"3777500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloodmatch", "steam_appid": 3777500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4309560], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodmatch is a first-person arena battler, boasting brutal melee combat, branching paths, and a menagerie of bloodthirsty opponents - from vicious wild beasts to brutal barbarians. Take your combatant through multiple arenas on your quest for freedom and valour - and give your callous crowd a show they’ll never forget. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Rags to Roma - </strong>Rise through the ranks of the gladiatorial circuit to become the land’s most fearsome fighter, starting as a lowly slave and slowly becoming the ultimate period pugilist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blades, Blood, and Broadswords</strong> - Wield maces, longswords, spears and hammers with the age-authentic arsenal you’ve come to expect from DOSMan games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rend and Repeat - </strong>Branching paths and randomised weapon drops make for an unpredictable - and highly replayable - rampage through the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Match Made in Hell - </strong>From one-on-one battles to high-intensity gauntlets, the rules of the ring are always evolving - so pick your battles wisely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mettle Meets Metal - </strong>Rock out to a punchy Metal-coded acoustic OST by Bret Ware - guitarist and vocalist of UK metal band ZILF.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodmatch is another bite-sized brawler from the folk at DOSMan games, combining their trademark pixel art, unforgettable soundtrack, and pick-up-and-play mentality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodmatch is a first-person arena battler, boasting brutal melee combat, branching paths, and a menagerie of bloodthirsty opponents - from vicious wild beasts to brutal barbarians. Take your combatant through multiple arenas on your quest for freedom and valour - and give your callous crowd a show they’ll never forget. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Rags to Roma - </strong>Rise through the ranks of the gladiatorial circuit to become the land’s most fearsome fighter, starting as a lowly slave and slowly becoming the ultimate period pugilist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blades, Blood, and Broadswords</strong> - Wield maces, longswords, spears and hammers with the age-authentic arsenal you’ve come to expect from DOSMan games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rend and Repeat - </strong>Branching paths and randomised weapon drops make for an unpredictable - and highly replayable - rampage through the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Match Made in Hell - </strong>From one-on-one battles to high-intensity gauntlets, the rules of the ring are always evolving - so pick your battles wisely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mettle Meets Metal - </strong>Rock out to a punchy Metal-coded acoustic OST by Bret Ware - guitarist and vocalist of UK metal band ZILF.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodmatch is another bite-sized brawler from the folk at DOSMan games, combining their trademark pixel art, unforgettable soundtrack, and pick-up-and-play mentality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The arena beckons. Sharpen your steel. Slash, stab, and spear your way through the ranks of Rome’s toughest warriors, taking yourself from a lowly pit slave to the land's most glorified gladiator. Your audience awaits…", "supported_languages"